\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $-11,$ $-5,$ $2,$ and $12.$ \n\n- The largest output is $12,$ and it occurs at $x=0.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-11,$ and it occurs at $x=3.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =12 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =0 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-11 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" "answer-field-213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" "answer-field-00f24f4e-6b01-5041-96f3-1e504afd4cc9" "answer-field-d89b729b-6562-5fd3-b346-f1e8480afff7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" :answer-field/id #uuid "3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a" :answer/id #uuid "3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" :answer-field/id #uuid "213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-