 is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}g(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}g(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $5,-3,10,$ and $0.$ \n\n- The largest output is $10,$ and it occurs at $x=6.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-3,$ and it occurs at $x=4.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =10 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =6 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =-3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231036 :answer-field/correct "answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799" :answer-field/choices ["answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799" :answer/id #uuid "dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231038 :answer-field/correct "answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d" :answer/id #uuid "bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231039 :answer-field/correct "answer-df0ead68-c7d0-5780-b65f-80ccfac3a607" :answer-field/choices ["answer-df0ead68-c7d0-5780-b65f-80ccfac3a607"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-df0ead68-c7d0-5780-b65f-80ccfac3a607" :answer/id #uuid "df0ead68-c7d0-5780-b65f-80ccfac3a607" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231037 :answer-field/correct "answer-72902395-16fd-5793-90b2-da8b3781324c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-72902395-16fd-5793-90b2-da8b3781324c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-72902395-16fd-5793-90b2-da8b3781324c" :answer/id #uuid "72902395-16fd-5793-90b2-da8b3781324c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-dae35b84-ab79-5551-9374-7336192ddee8" :question/id #uuid "dae35b84-ab79-5551-9374-7336192ddee8" :question/math-academy-id "q-355378" :question/problem "Let $S=\\{-5,2,4,7\\}$ and suppose\n\n$$\nf(4)=-8,\\,f(-5)=1,\\,f(7)=3,\\,f(2)=10.\n$$\n\nCompute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $-8,$ $1,$ $3,$ and $10.$ \n\n- The largest output is $10,$ and it occurs at $x=2.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-8,$ and it occurs at $x=4.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =10 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =2 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-8 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8a466fba-def7-55ba-8f8f-e4d5b58d8d7b" "answer-field-bbb2ab49-40eb-5b48-800d-507bb695f316" "answer-field-a8adcb23-4793-5db2-b42b-3165ad50dc81" "answer-field-f5f2cbab-fe79-531d-989d-eb0bd6dc2ed9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8a466fba-def7-55ba-8f8f-e4d5b58d8d7b" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a466fba-def7-55ba-8f8f-e4d5b58d8d7b" :answer-field/key "fie