5385" :question/problem "Let $S=\\{-3,-1,2,4\\}$ and suppose\n\n$$\nf(-3)=5,\\,f(-1)=1,\\,f(2)=1,\\,f(4)=8.\n$$\n\nCompute ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x).$\n\n$\\,$\n${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $5,$ $1,$ $1,$ and $8,$ so the minimum output value is $1.$ This minimum occurs at both $x=-1$ and $x=2.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=1\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=\\{-1,2\\}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-dea23e0a-f02d-57be-9af6-ef1ec5ff726d" "answer-field-b701b809-a911-5205-b2f8-0feb7edf259f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-dea23e0a-f02d-57be-9af6-ef1ec5ff726d" :answer-field/id #uuid "dea23e0a-f02d-57be-9af6-ef1ec5ff726d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-acc90f90-20a4-5ab7-9cc7-f5256d6b72a0" :answer-field/choices ["answer-8f41a682-ab0b-5931-8d0f-f6dc1f0b19d6" "answer-acc90f90-20a4-5ab7-9cc7-f5256d6b72a0" "answer-5867a175-6ed7-56f3-a3c6-f5ec652ea39c" "answer-24e4e581-cd1a-580b-b032-c609777f53f9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8f41a682-ab0b-5931-8d0f-f6dc1f0b19d6" :answer/id #uuid "8f41a682-ab0b-5931-8d0f-f6dc1f0b19d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-acc90f90-20a4-5ab7-9cc7-f5256d6b72a0" :answer/id #uuid "acc90f90-20a4-5ab7-9cc7-f5256d6b72a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5867a175-6ed7-56f3-a3c6-f5ec652ea39c" :answer/id #uuid "5867a175-6ed7-56f3-a3c6-f5ec652ea39c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/v