-2,\\,f(3)=5,\\,f(7)=3.\n$$\n\nCompute ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x).$\n\n$\\,$\n${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nThe outputs are $5,$ $-2,$ $5,$ and $3,$ so the maximum output value is $5.$ This maximum occurs at both $x=-4$ and $x=3.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=5\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=\\{-4,3\\}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-eaa4f776-3456-50ae-b247-8f35eba24311" "answer-field-0694b919-f666-5cf0-8eef-96291747b094"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-eaa4f776-3456-50ae-b247-8f35eba24311" :answer-field/id #uuid "eaa4f776-3456-50ae-b247-8f35eba24311" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-e9465caf-0b88-5c15-9dc9-443f0c233079" :answer-field/choices ["answer-14979d5c-1315-518c-a575-67cd81a9750d" "answer-b6ae3a65-5422-5563-8291-80cc3bcb2795" "answer-13a1046d-462e-51f8-b944-d80f1774270b" "answer-e9465caf-0b88-5c15-9dc9-443f0c233079"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14979d5c-1315-518c-a575-67cd81a9750d" :answer/id #uuid "14979d5c-1315-518c-a575-67cd81a9750d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b6ae3a65-5422-5563-8291-80cc3bcb2795" :answer/id #uuid "b6ae3a65-5422-5563-8291-80cc3bcb2795" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-13a1046d-462e-51f8-b944-d80f1774270b" :answer/id #uuid "13a1046d-462e-51f8-b944-d80f1774270b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e9465caf-0b88-5c15-9dc9-443f0c2330