"] ["question-70f30638-2aaa-5352-bc26-9df3570b67f9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-1ee30075-ef1d-5646-bf59-1a1cf206b83f"] ["question-70f30638-2aaa-5352-bc26-9df3570b67f9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-45974829-4fca-57ca-9073-a7dd2f9bde6c"] ["question-70f30638-2aaa-5352-bc26-9df3570b67f9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-081ebd9b-ca0f-5b1c-89d9-c6f0062cfe66"] ["question-70f30638-2aaa-5352-bc26-9df3570b67f9" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-7eb194c3-5312-5415-a2f8-09fa9542b93e"] [17592186231450 :knowledge-point/questions "question-70f30638-2aaa-5352-bc26-9df3570b67f9"] ["question-bcdc2275-c8f5-5708-9f40-dd5af1bab702" :question/id #uuid "bcdc2275-c8f5-5708-9f40-dd5af1bab702"] ["question-bcdc2275-c8f5-5708-9f40-dd5af1bab702" :question/math-academy-id "q-355380"] ["question-bcdc2275-c8f5-5708-9f40-dd5af1bab702" :question/problem "Let $S=\\{-7,0,3,8\\}$ and suppose\n\n$$\nf(3)=-11,\\,f(-7)=-5,\\,f(8)=2,\\,f(0)=12.\n$$\n\nCompute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-4}}"] ["question-bcdc2275-c8f5-5708-9f40-dd5af1bab702" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $-11,$ $-5,$ $2,$ and $12.$ \n\n- The largest output is $12,$ and it occurs at $x=0.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-11,$ and it occurs at $x=3.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =12 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =0 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-11 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-bcdc2275-c8f5-5708-9f40-dd5af1bab702" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" :answer-field/id #uuid "3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1"] ["answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a" :answer/id #uuid "3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a"] ["answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a" :answer/value "12"] ["answer-field-3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" :answer-field/correct "answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a"] ["answer-field-3315d324-57f9-5d96-a6ea-2e03d67dc9a1" :answer-field/choices "answer-3207c8bf-2367-5c78-bd08-f0168741342a"] ["answer-field-213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" :answer-field/id #uuid "213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424"] ["answer-b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7" :answer/id #uuid "b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7"] ["answer-b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-field-213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" :answer-field/key "field-2"] ["answer-field-213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" :answer-field/correct "answer-b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7"] ["answer-field-213e1ea3-e746-5bd0-9775-d6e0a2d1e424" :answer-field/choices "answer-b91d0da4-4e21-54ff-b39f-e67a4d4817f7"] ["answer-field-00f24f4e-6b01-5041-96f3-1e504afd4cc9" :answer-field/id #uuid "00f24f4e-6b01-5041-96f3-1e504afd4cc9"] ["answer-2386d57b-ed50-53d0-80cf-499c5d294b01" :answer/id #uuid "2386d57b-ed50-53d0-80cf-499c5d294b01"] ["answer-2386d57b-ed50-53d0-80cf-499c5d294b01" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["ans