te the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in S}g(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}g(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in S}g(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}g(x)=$\n{{field-4}}"] [17592186231742 :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}g(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}g(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}g(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}g(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $5,-3,10,$ and $0.$ \n\n- The largest output is $10,$ and it occurs at $x=6.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-3,$ and it occurs at $x=4.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =10 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =6 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =-3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}g(x) & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186231742 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799" :answer/id #uuid "dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799"] ["answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799" :answer/value "10"] [17592186231036 :answer-field/correct "answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799"] [17592186231036 :answer-field/choices "answer-dc9552db-fabc-56c1-84f8-b62c633ab799"] ["answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d" :answer/id #uuid "bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d"] ["answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d" :answer/value "6"] [17592186231038 :answer-field/correct "answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d"] [17592186231038 :answer-field/choices "answer-bba1a4dc-f05d-5122-85ca-f2df6c6af91d"] ["answer-df0ead68-c7d0-5780-b65f-80ccfac3a607" :answer/id #uuid "df0ead68-c7d0-