-5551-9374-7336192ddee8"] ["question-c1599c17-000c-53e6-a6c2-601e2c06fa87" :question/id #uuid "c1599c17-000c-53e6-a6c2-601e2c06fa87"] ["question-c1599c17-000c-53e6-a6c2-601e2c06fa87" :question/math-academy-id "q-355377"] ["question-c1599c17-000c-53e6-a6c2-601e2c06fa87" :question/problem "Let $S=\\{-8,-3,0,9\\}$ and suppose\n\n$$\nf(-8)=5,\\,f(-3)=-12,\\,f(0)=11,\\,f(9)=1.\n$$\n\nCompute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)=$\n{{field-4}}"] ["question-c1599c17-000c-53e6-a6c2-601e2c06fa87" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the largest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nHere, the outputs are $5,$ $-12,$ $11,$ and $1.$ \n\n- The largest output is $11,$ and it occurs at $x=0.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-12,$ and it occurs at $x=-3.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =11 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =0 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-12 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-c1599c17-000c-53e6-a6c2-601e2c06fa87" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-745e8559-3502-5e71-818c-397d914d5c1c" :answer-field/id #uuid "745e8559-3502-5e71-818c-397d914d5c1c"] ["answer-14f2b348-b686-5c07-86c7-7171577ae800" :answer/id #uuid "14f2b348-b686-5c07-86c7-7171577ae800"] ["answer-14f2b348-b686-5c07-86c7-7171577ae800" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-14f2b348-b686-5c07-86c7-7171577ae800" :answer/value "11"] ["answer-field-745e8559-3502-5e71-818c-397d914d5c1c" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answ