e\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that largest output occurs.\n\nThe outputs are $12,$ $12,$ $3,$ and $-5,$ so the maximum output value is $12.$ This maximum occurs at both $x=-2$ and $x=-4.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=12\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)=\\{-2,-4\\}.\n$$"] ["question-d67215f0-5168-5f34-aa11-965cede50421" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-6c3d2b42-8fd4-5df8-b7da-2c54fbf234ed" :answer-field/id #uuid "6c3d2b42-8fd4-5df8-b7da-2c54fbf234ed"] ["answer-b0b69ad2-29e6-5a20-847e-967b09441245" :answer/id #uuid "b0b69ad2-29e6-5a20-847e-967b09441245"] ["answer-b0b69ad2-29e6-5a20-847e-967b09441245" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b0b69ad2-29e6-5a20-847e-967b09441245" :answer/value "-2"] ["answer-e640bf6a-d267-504b-bdad-2d73cb19b932" :answer/id #uuid "e640bf6a-d267-504b-bdad-2d73cb19b932"] ["answer-e640bf6a-d267-504b-bdad-2d73cb19b932" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e640bf6a-d267-504b-bdad-2d73cb19b932" :answer/value "-5"] ["answer-c3f25b4e-6dba-5c37-a869-7bf51a994ebe" :answer/id #uuid "c3f25b4e-6dba-5c37-a869-7bf51a994ebe"] ["answer-c3f25b4e-6dba-5c37-a869-7bf51a994ebe" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c3f25b4e-6dba-5c37-a869-7bf51a994ebe" :answer/value "12"] ["answer-6509b98d-2629-5a0a-9c3c-d49a4074e5f3" :answer/id #uuid "6509b98d-2629-5a0a-9c3c-d49a4074e5f3"] ["answer-6509b98d-2629-5a0a-9c3c-d49a4074e5f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6509b98d-2629-5a0a-9c3c-d49a4074e5f3" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-field-6c3d2b42-8fd4-5df8-b7da-2c54fbf234ed" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-6c3d2b42-8fd4-5df8-b7da-2c54fbf234ed" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select] ["answer-field-6c3d2b42-8fd4-5df8-b7da-2c54fbf234ed" :answer-field/correct "answer-c3f25b4e-6dba-5c37-a869-7bf51a994ebe"] ["answer-field-6c3d2b42-8fd4-5df8-b7da-2c54fbf234ed" :answer-field/choices "answer-b0b69ad2-29e6-5a20-847e-967b09441245"] ["answer-field-